ize-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/fdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Printer icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Flexible printing options</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for FREE<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/b82a1925-5ffc-46c0-8e22-29fd200a2721_strapped+items.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Strapped boxes icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Bulk send</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Book multiple parcels online all at once using our bulk send tool<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/f67d24e2-931f-4df2-b583-2c51af7d6cf4_courier3.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Icon of a courier" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Courier collection</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Book a parcel collection from your doorstep and get a 1-hour window on the day for only 50p extra <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/77f34345-2ded-4116-bbc6-819ed2588756_help+1.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Help icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>24/7 live chat</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Speak to a real person on our <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/help-and-support/help-centre" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->website<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> to answer your questions and help resolve any concerns<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Success icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Trusted by top UK brands</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We&#39;re trusted to deliver for many of the UK&#39;s biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo, Gymshark, House of Fraser, Lonsdale and Lookfantastic, just to name a few<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="where-to-drop-off-your-parcel-to-croatia-" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="3Column" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Where to drop off your parcel to Croatia <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h2><!--]--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We send parcels at your convenience. With our ever-expanding network of ParcelShops and Lockers, we’re closer to your community than ever. Combine that with our courier collection service and parcel drop-off will never be a hassle for Evri customers. Find out more about these services:  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJXZbqstJ9-TgB_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3194a3f4.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJXZbqstJ9-TgB_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3194.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=30%2C0%2C4564%2C3035&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJXZbqstJ9-TgB_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3194.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=30%2C0%2C4564%2C3035&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJXZbqstJ9-TgB_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3194.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=30%2C0%2C4564%2C3035&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="ParcelShop store assistant is standing at the till and smiling, posing for the photo." width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShops<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Drop off your parcel at one of our 9,000+ ParcelShops located all over the country. Book your parcel online and print your label at home or in-store at your nearest ParcelShop using our Print in ParcelShop devices. You can also book your delivery in person at selected Post Offices. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Find your local ParcelShop-open Find your local ParcelShop page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/find-a-parcelshop" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Find your local ParcelShop<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033447f.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C9%2C8164%2C5445&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C9%2C8164%2C5445&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C9%2C8164%2C5445&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out" width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Lockers<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->With Lockers available to Evri customers in neighbourhoods across the UK, safe and secure parcel drop-off is right around the corner. Just locate your nearest Locker, scan the barcode, and pop your parcel inside ready to be collected. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Locate your nearest Locker-open Locate your nearest Locker page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/find-a-parcelshop" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Locate your nearest Locker<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDnpbqstJ9-cfe_EVRI_LOCATION_04_42238a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDnpbqstJ9-cfe_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4223.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDnpbqstJ9-cfe_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4223.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDnpbqstJ9-cfe_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4223.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri Courier greeting a customer as they begin a doorstep collection. The customer has their parcel ready to hand off, and the courier has a blue slip ready to record the collection." width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Courier collection<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We make parcel drop-off simple and stress-free. Book a courier collection to get your parcel on the move directly from your home or office. Simply choose a date that suits you and we’ll provide a 1-hour window to come and collect.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Book a courier collection today-open Book a courier collection today page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/courier-service" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Book a courier collection today<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="customs-made-simple-with-evri" class="section-wrapper" index="6" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7819bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7819.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7819.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7819.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A woman is sat at home at her desk smiling looking at her laptop screen" width="1000" height="665" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Customs made simple with Evri</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you’re worried about customs forms and admin, don’t be! At Evri we take care of all the paperwork for you by processing it all in the background using the information you provide when you make the booking. We even have a lookup function for HS codes, so just tell us what’s in the box and we’ll fill that part in for you. Sending a parcel internationally should be stress free, so make it stress free by sending with Evri today.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Send a parcel to Croatia" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/international-send" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.92 8.42 7.68 8.42 7.4C8.42 7.12 8.52 6.88 8.7 6.7C8.88 6.52 9.12 6.42 9.4 6.42C9.68 6.42 9.92 6.52 10.1 6.7L14.7 11.3C14.8 11.4 14.87 11.51 14.91 11.62C14.95 11.74 14.97 11.87 14.97 12C14.97 12.13 14.95 12.26 14.91 12.38C14.87 12.49 14.8 12.6 14.7 12.7L10.1 17.3C9.92 17.48 9.68 17.57 9.4 17.57C9.12 17.57 8.88 17.48 8.7 17.3C8.52 17.12 