28 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8377.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Business owner sat at a desk in their home office using their laptop to book multiple parcels" width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Sending multiple parcels to Croatia</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We’ve made it easy to start shipping to Croatia with our <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/customer/bulk-upload" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->bulk integrations tool<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->. Simply follow the steps below and enter the details for all your parcels in one go to send them on their way: <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ol><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Link your Evri account with your marketplace seller’s account or upload your parcels using a CSV file <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Book your parcels in one go <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Package up your items and print off your postage label at home or in-store <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Send your parcels using any of our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers or book a courier collection <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ol><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Send mu