 can ship on a budget. Covering the long and illustrious Croatian coast, and all the way inland to the capital city of Zagreb, our parcel network knows few bounds. With our customs-made-simple booking process, we make sending parcels across borders hassle-free – send a parcel to Croatia today.  ",[],"ltr",{"type":88,"text":93,"spans":94,"direction":91},"We’ve made great strides in order to connect Evri customers with the rest of Europe, so whether you’re looking to send a parcel to the Netherlands, or need shipping to Spain, we’ve got you covered with competitive rates and trusted delivery.",[95,109,111,122],{"start":96,"end":97,"type":98,"data":99},114,146,"hyperlink",{"id":100,"type":101,"tags":102,"lang":15,"slug":104,"first_publication_date":105,"last_publication_date":106,"uid":107,"url":108,"link_type":18,"isBroken":20},"YqcrgxIAACMAo98O","content-page",[103],"International","how-to-send-parcels-to-the-netherlands","2022-06-20T15:38:14+0000","2026-06-12T08:07:08+0000","netherlands","\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fnetherlands",{"start":96,"end":97,"type":110},"strong",{"start":112,"end":113,"type":98,"data":114},156,173,{"id":115,"type":101,"tags":116,"lang":15,"slug":117,"first_publication_date":118,"last_publication_date":119,"uid":120,"url":121,"link_type":18,"isBroken":20},"YtEVjhAAAB8AZr9V",[103],"how-to-send-parcels-to-spain","2022-07-20T23:00:16+0000","2026-06-12T08:10:28+0000","spain","\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fspain",{"start":112,"end":113,"type":110},"card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":126,"version":31,"items":127,"primary":143,"id":152,"slice_type":153,"slice_label":46},"2ColumnTableButton",[128,131,134,137,140],{"Col1Content":129,"Col2Content":130},"250g","£8.89",{"Col1Content":132,"Col2Content":133},"500g","£9.59",{"Col1Content":135,"Col2Content":136},"1kg","£10.89",{"Col1Content":138,"Col2Content":139},"2kg","£12.09",{"Col1Content":141,"Col2Content":142},"5kg","£33.69",{"SectionTitle":144,"SectionSubtitle":145,"Col1Header":146,"Col2Header":147,"InformationTableButtonUrl":148,"InformationTableButtonText":151,"isTableShort":20},"How much does it cost to send a parcel to Croatia?","Like the rest of our European services, we price our shipping to Croatia based on weight. Below you can check out a table that compares the prices of some of our more popular weights. Each price is quoted with a ParcelShop or Locker drop-off, with doorstep courier collection being an extra 50p for all weights.","Parcel weight","Prices from",{"link_type":36,"key":149,"url":150},"5a78947b-05b8-473a-a38a-3838678545a0","croatia.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Finternational-send","Send a parcel to Croatia today","information_table$f82345cd-ef2a-46c0-baee-2cacc12cf155","information_table",{"variation":155,"version":31,"items":156,"primary":158,"id":233,"slice_type":124,"slice_label":46},"cardNoImageWithCta",[157],{},{"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":159,"CardText":160,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":231,"IsEco":20},"Croatian public holidays 2026",[161,164,170,175,179,184,189,193,198,202,207,212,216,221,226],{"type":88,"text":162,"spans":163,"direction":91},"When sending a parcel to Croatia, there are some public holidays that may affect shipping times. To ensure that your parcel arrives when you want it to, be mindful of these dates in 2026:  ",[],{"type":165,"text":166,"spans":167,"direction":91},"list-item","New Year’s Day – 01\u002F01\u002F2026",[168],{"start":66,"end":169,"type":110},14,{"type":165,"text":171,"spans":172,"direction":91},"Epiphany – 06\u002F01\u002F2026",[173],{"start":66,"end":174,"type":110},9,{"type":165,"text":176,"spans":177,"direction":91},"Easter Sunday – 05\u002F04\u002F2026",[178],{"start":66,"end":169,"type":110},{"type":165,"text":180,"spans":181,"direction":91},"Easter Monday – 06\u002F04\u002F2026",[182],{"start":66,"end":183,"type":110},13,{"type":165,"text":185,"spans":186,"direction":91},"International Workers' Day – 01\u