parcel collection from your doorstep and get a 1-hour window on the day for only 50p extra ",[],{"dimensions":301,"alt":302,"copyright":46,"url":303,"id":304,"edit":305},{"width":252,"height":252},"Icon of a courier","croatia.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff67d24e2-931f-4df2-b583-2c51af7d6cf4_courier3.svg","Yh96FhIAACkA-Zr4",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":307,"content":308,"icon":318},"24\u002F7 live chat",[309],{"type":88,"text":310,"spans":311,"direction":91},"Speak to a real person on our website to answer your questions and help resolve any concerns",[312],{"start":313,"end":314,"type":98,"data":315},30,37,{"link_type":36,"url":316,"target":317},"croatia.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fhelp-and-support\u002Fhelp-centre\u002F","_self",{"dimensions":319,"alt":320,"copyright":46,"url":321,"id":322,"edit":323},{"width":252,"height":252},"Help icon","croatia.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F77f34345-2ded-4116-bbc6-819ed2588756_help+1.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zsw",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":325,"content":326,"icon":330},"Trusted by top UK brands",[327],{"type":88,"text":328,"spans":329,"direction":91},"We're trusted to deliver for many of the UK's biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo, Gymshark, House of Fraser, Lonsdale and Lookfantastic, just to name a few",[],{"dimensions":331,"alt":332,"copyright":46,"url":333,"id":334,"edit":335},{"width":252,"height":252},"Success icon","croatia.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"theme":337,"title":338,"description":339},"standard","Why send parcels to Croatia with Evri","As well as being affordable, the benefits of sending internationally with Evri just keep on growing. Check out just a few of the amazing features, services and testimonials that make us one of the best courier services:","list_block$5561303f-d955-4b8d-a3c8-2302fd07d450","list_block",{"variation":343,"version":31,"items":344,"primary":405,"id":415,"slice_type":416,"slice_label":46},"3Column",[345,366,386],{"Title":346,"Description":351,"Image":355,"Label":46,"UrlText":361,"Url":362,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":365,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[347],{"type":348,"text":349,"spans":350},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[352],{"type":88,"text":353,"spans":354,"direction":91},"Drop off your parcel at one of our 9,000+ ParcelShops located all over the country. Book your parcel online and print your label at home or in-store at your nearest ParcelShop using our Print in ParcelShop devices. You can also book your delivery in person at selected Post Offices. ",[],{"dimensions":356,"alt":357,"copyright":46,"url":358,"id":359,"edit":360},{"width":78,"height":79},"ParcelShop store assistant is standing at the till and smiling, posing for the photo.","croatia.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJXZbqstJ9-TgB_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3194.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=30%2C0%2C4564%2C3035&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJXZbqstJ9-TgB",{"x":313,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Find your local ParcelShop",{"link_type":36,"key":363,"url":364},"1cca406f-27ae-4d09-8f22-677c1b65d1d7","\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop",{"link_type":232},{"Title":367,"Description":371,"Image":375,"Label":46,"UrlText":382,"Url":383,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":385,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[368],{"type":348,"text":369,"spans":370},"Lockers",[],[372],{"type":88,"text":373,"spans":374,"direction":91},"With Lockers available to Evri customers in neighbourhoods across the UK, safe and secure parcel drop-off is right around the corner. Just locate your nearest Locker, scan the barcode, and pop your parcel inside ready to be collected. ",[],{"dimensions":376,"alt":378,"copyright":46,"url":379,"id":380,"edit":381},{"width":78,"height":377},667,"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","croatia.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C9%2C8164%2C5445&w=1000&h=667","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":66,"y":174,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Locate your nearest Locker",{"link_type":36,"key":384,"url":364},"f1e23d2a-766b-443a-95a6-62e084df1b68",{"link_type":232},{"Title":387,"Description":390,"Image":394,"Label":46,"UrlText":400,"Url":401,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":404,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[388],{"type":348,"text":295,"spans":389,"direction":91},[],[391],{"type":88,"text":392,"spans":393,"direction":91},"We make parcel drop-off simple and stress-free. Book a courier collection to get your parcel on the move directly from your home or office. Simply choose a date that suits you and we’ll provide a 1-hour window to come and collect.  ",[],{"dimensions":395,"alt":396,"copyright":46,"url":397,"id":398,"edit":399},{"width":78,"height":377},"An Evri Courier greeting a customer as they begin a doorstep collection. The customer has their parcel ready to hand off, and the courier has a blue slip ready to record the collection.","croatia.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDnpbqstJ9-cfe_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4223.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6pDnpbqstJ9-cfe",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Book a courier collection today",{"link_type":36,"key":402,"url":403},"f980a8e2-e519-489e-acfb-954b3235624e","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":232},{"SectionTitle":406,"SectionDescription":411,"theme":46},[407],{"type":408,"text":409,"spans":410,"direction":91},"heading2","Where to drop off your parcel to Croatia ",[],[412],{"type":88,"text":413,"spans":414,"direction":91},"We send parcels at your convenience. With our ever-expanding network of ParcelShops and Lockers, we’re closer to your community than ever. Combine that with our courier collection service and parcel drop-off will never be a hassle for Evri customers. Find out more about these services:  ",[],"article_link_module$8c909b79-e19e-4a7d-8e65-e4daad61827d","article_link_module",{"variation":418,"version":31,"items":419,"primary":420,"id":435,"slice_type":124,"slice_label":46},"default-slice",[],{"CardImage":421,"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":428,"CardText":429,"ButtonText":45,"ButtonUrl":433,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":422,"alt":423,"copyright":46,"url":424,"id":425,"edit":426},{"width":78,"height":79},"A woman is sat at home at her desk smiling looking at her laptop screen","croatia.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7819.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ",{"x":66,"y":427,"zoom":67,"background":68},8,"Customs made simple with Evri",[430],{"type":88,"text":431,"spans":432,"direction":91},"If you’re worried about customs forms and admin, don’t be! At Evri we take care of all the paperwork for you by processing it all in the background using the information you provide when you make the booking. We even have a lookup function for HS codes, so just tell us what’s in the box and we’ll fill that part in for you. Sending a parcel internationally should be stress free, so make it stress free by sending with Evri today.  ",[],{"link_type":36,"key":434,"url":150},"b98f3e26-75c2-4f87-8f65-31d4469f6d02","card$c1d3910c-7ce1-4347-9ab5-34e40a08b7bb",{"variation":155,"version":31,"items":437,"primary":439,"id":467,"slice_type":124,"slice_label":46},[438],{},{"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":440,"CardText":441,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":466,"IsEco":20},"What you can and can’t send to Croatia",[442,449],{"type":88,"text":443,"spans":444,"direction":91},"While we welcome a wide variety of items into our parcel network, there are a few things that we are unfortunately unable to deliver for you. Read our comprehensive list of what you can and can’t send with Evri. ",[445,448],{"start":113,"end":446,"type":98,"data":447},200,{"link_type":36,"url":43,"target":317},{"start":113,"end":446,"type":110},{"type":88,"text":450,"spans":451,"direction":91},"Alongside this, it’s also worth checking the IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations, and the UK Civil Aviation Authority pages for up-to-date information on any international sending restrictions. ",[452,457,458,461,465],{"start":453,"end":454,"type":98,"data":455},45,77,{"link_type":36,"url":456,"target":248},"croatia.html\u002F\u002Fwww.iata.org\u002Fen\u002Fpublications\u002Fdgr\u002F",{"start":453,"end":454,"type":110},{"start":459,"end":460,"type":110},78,79,{"start":462,"end":96,"type":98,"data":463},87,{"link_type":36,"url":464,"target":248},"croatia.html\u002F\u002Fwww.caa.co.uk\u002Fpassengers\u002FBefore-you-fly\u002FBaggage\u002FBanned-items\u002F",{"start":462,"end":96,"type":110},{"link_type":232},"card$8b9d5118-024d-4b2c-ae3b-e430dc424436",{"variation":155,"version":31,"items":469,"primary":471,"id":515,"slice_type":124,"slice_label":46},[470],{},{"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":472,"CardText":473,"ButtonText":45,"ButtonUrl":513,"IsEco":20},"How to format an address when sending to Croatia",[474,477,480,483,486,489,492,496,501,505,510],{"type":88,"text":475,"spans":476,"direction":91},"It’s always worth checking that the address format on your parcel is correct so that there are no issues delivering to your recipient. Follow this structure to ensure a swift delivery:  ",[],{"type":165,"text":478,"spans":479,"direction":91},"Recipient name ",[],{"type":165,"text":481,"spans":482,"direction":91},"Street name and building number ",[],{"type":165,"text":484,"spans":485,"direction":91},"Postcode followed by post office name ",[],{"type":165,"text":487,"spans":488,"direction":91},"Country ",[],{"type":88,"text":490,"spans":491,"direction":91},"For example,  ",[],{"type":88,"text":493,"spans":494,"direction":91},"Mr. Ivan Horvat ",[495],{"start":66,"end":197,"type":110},{"type":88,"text":497,"spans":498,"direction":91},"Krapinska 17\u002FI stan 4 ",[499],{"start":66,"end":500,"type":110},21,{"type":88,"text":502,"spans":503,"direction":91},"HR-10000 Zagreb ",[504],{"start":66,"end":197,"type":110},{"type":88,"text":506,"spans":507,"direction":91},"Croatia ",[508],{"start":66,"end":509,"type":110},7,{"type":88,"text":511,"spans":512,"direction":91},"Fear not if this is confusing, just enter the address information at checkout and we will be able to validate it to ensure that it is a recognised address. We will also ensure that it’s formatted correctly so that you can rest at ease whilst it crosses borders.  ",[],{"link_type":36,"key":514,"url":150},"e883c23c-2067-4b01-921e-7be469f61f22","card$01a6a053-7981-4f82-bc6b-1ba7078276c6",{"variation":418,"version":31,"items":517,"primary":519,"id":551,"slice_type":124,"slice_label":46},[518],{},{"CardImage":520,"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":526,"CardText":527,"ButtonText":548,"ButtonUrl":549,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":521,"alt":522,"copyright":46,"url":523,"id":524,"edit":525},{"width":78,"height":377},"Business owner sat at a desk in their home office using their laptop to book multiple parcels","croatia.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8377.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Sending multiple parcels to Croatia",[528,535,539,542,545],{"type":88,"text":529,"spans":530,"direction":91},"We’ve made it easy to start shipping to Croatia with our bulk integrations tool. Simply follow the steps below and enter the details for all your parcels in one go to send them on their way: ",[531,534],{"start":532,"end":460,"type":98,"data":533},57,{"link_type":36,"url":38,"target":248},{"start":532,"end":460,"type":110},{"type":536,"text":537,"spans":538,"direction":91},"o-list-item","Link your Evri account with your marketplace seller’s account or upload your parcels using a CSV file ",[],{"type":536,"text":540,"spans":541,"direction":91},"Book your parcels in one go ",[],{"type":536,"text":543,"spans":544,"direction":91},"Package up your items and print off your postage label at home or in-store ",[],{"type":536,"text":546,"spans":547,"direction":91},"Send your parcels using any of our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers or book a courier collection ",[],"Send multiple parcels to Croatia",{"link_type":36,"key":550,"url":38},"e6974bb4-4ba1-4fc3-9fcf-26c634ea06e8","card$93d4bb75-307c-477d-b60c-f6458e923fd2",{"variation":418,"version":31,"items":553,"primary":589,"id":591,"slice_type":592,"slice_label":46},[554,560,577],{"questionTitle":555,"questionBody":556},"How long does it take to send a parcel to Croatia?",[557],{"type":88,"text":558,"spans":559,"direction":91},"A parcel to Croatia once dropped off at a ParcelShop or Locker should take around 9-12 days to arrive at its destination.",[],{"questionTitle":561,"questionBody":562},"Is there an import tax from the UK to Croatia?",[563,566,569],{"type":88,"text":564,"spans":565,"direction":91},"When sending parcels to Croatia, you may need to pay customs fees and VAT. The amount can depend on the destination, purpose, and value of your parcel. Your customs duty and fees will be included in the price you pay at checkout.  ",[],{"type":88,"text":567,"spans":568,"direction":91},"If your recipient needs to pay customs duty, remember to let them know. We’ll contact your recipient and share a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items. ",[],{"type":88,"text":570,"spans":571,"direction":91},"Check out our simple guide on how to send an international parcel for more information. ",[572,576],{"start":313,"end":573,"type":98,"data":574},65,{"link_type":36,"url":575,"target":248},"\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel",{"start":313,"end":573,"type":110},{"questionTitle":578,"questionBody":579},"Can I track my parcels to Croatia?",[580],{"type":88,"text":581,"spans":582,"direction":91},"Absolutely. We offer end to end tracking on all of our parcels for no additional cost. Simply input your tracking number on our international tracking page and you’ll be able to see your parcel’s progress. ",[583,588],{"start":584,"end":585,"type":98,"data":586},128,155,{"link_type":36,"url":587,"target":248},"croatia.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":584,"end":585,"type":110},{"title":590},"Frequently asked questions","frequently_asked_questions$4c469f65-6730-41ff-8952-2d59d83cd157","frequently_asked_questions",[29,71,125,154,234,342,417,436,468,516,552],["Reactive",595],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":596,"$sclients":663,"$sglobal-basket-count":46,"$sglobal-user-postcode":666},{"abtasty":597,"accessibe":601,"appPromoBanner":604,"autoDivertUpdates":607,"awin":610,"bulkInternational":613,"bulkSendEnabled":616,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":619,"enableBasketCount":622,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":625,"euCustomsDuty":628,"groovyAdvert":631,"newInternationalSendFlow":634,"newinternationalpages":641,"oohPreferenceFlag":645,"opentel":648,"premium":651,"savedCards":654,"smallParcelSize":657,"yourPricesDrawer":660},{"_createdAt":598,"_updatedAt":599,"enabled":600},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",true,{"_createdAt":602,"_updatedAt":603,"enabled":600},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":605,"_updatedAt":606,"enabled":20},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":608,"_updatedAt":609,"enabled":20},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26:45.355Z",{"_createdAt":611,"_updatedAt":612,"enabled":20},"2025-08-19T09:46:14.552Z","2025-09-02T10:23:26.022Z",{"_createdAt":614,"_updatedAt":615,"enabled":600},"2025-06-23T14:37:21.102Z","2026-01-28T10:04:13.631Z",{"_createdAt":617,"_updatedAt":618,"enabled":600},"2024-11-14T16:08:24.373Z","2025-06-05T12:32:29.563Z",{"_crea